    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Our podcast approaches the idea of \"redrawing the map\" from three distinct perspectives, examining the ways in which this elusive concept pertains to crossword puzzles, data sonification, and procrastination. The podcast is, at heart, a celebration of the exploratory aspects of the human spirit, and a testament to the myriad ways in which each and every one of us innovates on a day to day basis.",
